        {
            "_id": "cBWJZvg7gqhaPBf2",
            "img": "systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp",
            "name": "Bloody Epiphany",
            "sort": 1200000,
            "system": {
                "actionType": {
                    "value": "passive"
                },
                "actions": {
                    "value": null
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>A creature hit by a kophos's chain scourge Strike must succeed at a @Check[fortitude|dc:38] save or take @Damage[2d6[persistent,bleed]] damage. For as long as it is taking this persistent damage, a creature is engrossed by the pain from its own wounds and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Slowed]{Slowed 1}. A creature stupefied by the kophos's silent agony can't willingly attempt to stop this bleeding, on itself or others. A creature that critically succeeds at its Fortitude save is temporarily immune to bloody epiphany for 24 hours.</p>"
                },
                "publication": {
                    "license": "OGL",
                    "remaster": false,
                    "title": ""
                },
                "rules": [],
                "slug": null,
