                    "value": 2
                },
                "category": "offensive",
                "description": {
                    "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> Three or more creatures within the kophos's silent agony aura are stupefied, slowed, or frightened</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> Each of the required creatures takes @Damage[5d6[mental]] damage (@Check[will|dc:38|basic] save), and the kophos regains a number of Hit Points equal to the highest amount of mental damage taken.</p>"
